id: draft-remctl-3.18-conan-buildenv-save-order
title: "配方用 Environment().define() 覆盖 profile [buildenv] 会静默失效——conanbuild.sh 按 env 脚本的保存顺序串 source，必须先 VirtualBuildEnv(self).generate() 再 save_script"
trigger_tool: conan / AutotoolsToolchain / VirtualBuildEnv
phase: configuration
error_signature: "configure: error: working directory cannot be determined|shell-init: error retrieving current directory|job-working-directory: error retrieving current directory"
prescan_pattern: "save_script\\(\"e386|define\\(\"CONFIG_SHELL\"|define\\(\"SHELL\""
prescan_globs: "archives/*/*/*/conanfile.py"
rec_command: "把 VirtualBuildEnv(self).generate() 移到配方自己的 Environment()/save_script() 之前"
fallback_command: "退路（DRAFT-6487 记录的形态）：在 self.run 的命令串里内联前缀 env -u CONFIG_SHELL SHELL=/bin/sh"
safety_boundary: "只适用于'配方要覆盖 profile [buildenv] 里同名变量'。仅新增变量（不与 profile 同名）时顺序无关；[runenv] 走 conanrun.sh 是另一条链，别照搬到 test_package 环境。同层需要叠加而非替换的变量（典型是 LD_LIBRARY_PATH）必须用 prepend_path，用 define 会把 profile 里 lld 依赖的 libxml2.so.16 路径整条抹掉"
similar_to: "E386（平台事实：HMDFS 拒绝对生成脚本的直接执行 + getcwd 风暴症状；本条不重复它，只补 conan 侧路由的生效条件）；DRAFT-6487-classads-configshell-hmdfs-getcwd（同症状同根因，那条给的解法是 build() 内联前缀；本条补的是 conan 环境脚本这条路的生效条件与失效陷阱）；DRAFT-E551（CONFIG_SHELL=bash 老 ltmain.sh 丢引号，手段相同根因不同）"
severity: P2
category: packaging|toolchain|autotools
last_updated: 2026-09-27
match_keywords: ["conanbuild.sh", "VirtualBuildEnv", "buildenv", "CONFIG_SHELL", "SHELL", "save_script", "source order", "getcwd", "silently overridden", "e386"]
keywords: "conan, VirtualBuildEnv, buildenv, 顺序, CONFIG_SHELL, SHELL, Environment.define, save_script, getcwd, HMDFS, hnp bash, E386"
approach: "在 generate() 里先调 VirtualBuildEnv(self).generate()（它把 profile [buildenv] 落成 conanbuildenv-<id>.sh），再创建自己的 Environment() 并 define + vars(scope=\"build\").save_script(...)，使配方脚本排在 source 链末尾，同名变量后写者胜"
root_cause: "conan 把 conanbuild.sh 生成成一条按各 env 脚本被保存的先后串起来的 source 链（不是文件名字母序）；profile 的 [buildenv] 由 VirtualBuildEnv 写进 conanbuildenv-<id>.sh，若配方先 save_script 自己的路由脚本、后（或由框架默认顺序）让 conanbuildenv 落位，则 conanbuildenv 在链尾重新导出 profile 的 CONFIG_SHELL/SHELL=/data/service/hnp/bin/bash，把配方的 /bin/sh 覆盖回去。conan 全程不给任何'变量被覆盖'告警，所以'写法看起来完全正确'与'根本没生效'在日志里长得一模一样。叠加事实：/bin/sh（hoshell）在 HMDFS 下 getcwd 正常，而 /data/service/hnp/bin/bash 在活目录里也报 getcwd Not supported——该失败是这个二进制的属性，不是构建目录被删"
error_excerpt: "shell-init: error retrieving current directory: getcwd: cannot access parent directories: Not a tty | job-working-directory: error retrieving current directory: getcwd: cannot access parent directories: No such file or directory | pwd: error retrieving current directory: getcwd: cannot access parent directories: Bad address | configure: error: working directory cannot be determined"
verification: "remctl/3.18 真机（2026-09-27，任务 10082）。改前 build-03：配方已 save_script('e386_shell_routing') 且脚本内容确为 export CONFIG_SHELL=/bin/sh，但 conanbuild.sh 的链序是 e386_shell_routing.sh -> conanautotoolstoolchain.sh -> conanbuildenv-release-armv8.sh，grep -ln hnp/bin/bash 只命中 conanbuildenv-release-armv8.sh，在 /bin/sh 里 . ./conanbuild.sh 后回读 SHELL=/data/service/hnp/bin/bash CONFIG_SHELL=/data/service/hnp/bin/bash，configure 死于 working directory cannot be determined（rc=1，MEMCAP peak=55MB）。改后 build-04 起：仅把 VirtualBuildEnv(self).generate() 提到 save_script 之前、配方零其他改动，configure 完整跑完进入 make；最终 build-16 整条 conan create rc=0（上游 Files=57, Tests=975, 63 由上游 skip_all 自跳, 0 失败；消费者 test_package ok 1..5）。未修复前 100% 复现"
repro_min: "任一 OHOS autotools 配方：generate() 内先 Environment().define('SHELL','/bin/sh') + save_script，再（或不调）VirtualBuildEnv → configure 报 working directory cannot be determined。免构建判别三条：①在构建目录 conan/ 下 grep -ln 'hnp/bin/bash' *.sh ②tr ' &' '\\n\\n\\n' < conanbuild.sh 看 source 链序 ③/bin/sh -c '. ./conanbuild.sh; echo $SHELL' 读终值（唯一可信判据）"
